# RESIZE down to a tiny 40x12 and back: no crash or garbage at the tiny
# size, and the layout recovers cleanly once it grows back.
@faux testdata/faux/hello.yaml
@size 120x40

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
SHOT before-tiny

RESIZE 40 12
WAIT 0.6
SHOT tiny-40x12
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/

RESIZE 120 40
WAITFOR /describe a task/ 10
SHOT back-120x40
EXPECT /describe a task/
EXPECT /ask before edits/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
